<title>KUWAIT: Man gets life for raping pregnant woman in Kuwait.</title>
<headline>Man gets life for raping pregnant woman in Kuwait.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Kuwaiti court sentenced a foreigner for life in prison for raping his friend's pregnant wife, al-Qabas newspaper reported on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said the victim was nine months pregnant when she was raped.</p>
<p>The daily said the convicted rapist was an unemployed foreign resident but did not give his name or nationality.</p>
</text>
